弱", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "7689-7695", "createTime": 1791103713, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "88967578_8cBnT5viu", "userVid": 88967578, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 88967578, "name": "Joey", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJictVtT2AMWSTzgqSsXAXeFNYJacxZzf2CWeLoSxWSeRNdyck9xmgKTbeNw7T24wLG5bU95c7YTgA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Joey", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "开卷有益，为学成己", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}}]}, {"range": "8149-8207", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 5, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "215171944_8bH3n14mf", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "布雷顿森林体系：\n简单说就是   1，定下了美元和黄金挂钩，1盎司黄金🟰x美元。\n2，其他货币和美元挂钩，1英镑🟰x美元。\n3，各国可以拿美元找美国换黄金。\n崩溃原因：美国当时越被世界信任，就越要印更多的美元给全世界用➡️但印的太多，人们就开始怀疑美国真的有这么多的黄金么，不信任就是崩溃的开始。➡️怀疑起来了，各国就抢着把美元换成黄金。➡️美国看这么多人要换黄金，扛不住了。➡️当时尼克松只能宣布，美元不再换黄金。这就是美元与黄金脱钩了，布雷顿森林体系崩溃。\n有什么影响：\n1黄金不再是货币的锚，各国的货币成了纯粹的信用货币，靠国家信用撑着。\n2 汇率开始大幅波动，以前和美元有固定比例，现在可以自由浮动（以前黄金和美元的兑换比例，各国货币和美元的兑换比例是固定的，现在黄金的锚没了，全靠国家信用撑着，市场相信你，就走高，不相信就走低，所以汇率不稳定）。\n3 通胀更容易发生，印钱不再受黄金的限制，各国可以“自由”放水。\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "8149-8207", "abstract": "在20世纪70年代长波的衰退期，布雷顿森林体系的崩溃实际上就是经济增长达到衰退阶段之后，主导国经济实力下降的一种反映", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "215171944_8bH3n14mf", "userVid": 215171944, "topics": [], "createTime": 1787904104, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 215171944, "name": "如淑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-HHSNbS4toXIXDABolQpEAf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "如淑", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "我听不懂你在说什么", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 2, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "254854030_87z2ypmjI", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "布雷顿森林体系的崩溃并不是一个偶然的金融事件，它是世界经济长波进入衰退期、作为体系主导国的美国经济实力相对下降的必然结果。布雷顿森林体系本质上是二战后美国凭借超强的经济、工业、黄金储备主导建立的国际货币秩序，以美元与黄金挂钩、其他货币与美元挂钩为核心，这套体系能够稳定运行的前提是美国经济持续强势、贸易持续顺差、黄金储备充足，能够支撑美元的信用和兑换承诺，而当长波周期走到衰退阶段，美国的经济增长动力减弱、产业竞争力下降、财政和贸易收支开始恶化，美元的信用基础随之动摇，这时候原本依靠美国霸权支撑的国际货币秩序就再也维持不下去，最终表现为布雷顿森林体系瓦解。所以体系崩溃本质上是长波衰退下主导国实力相对衰落在国际货币层面的体现，而不是单纯的政策失误或外部冲击造成的。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "在20世纪70年代长波的衰退期，布雷顿森林体系的崩溃实际上就是经济增长达到衰退阶段之后，主导国经济实力下降的一种反映。", "range": "8149-8208", "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "254854030_87z2ypmjI", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773362496, "userEditTime": 1790386978, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "217417001_840BH0Cdh", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "战后长波的上升期 → 造就了美国霸权及其制度体现（布雷顿森林体系）→ 长波进入尾声，主导国（美国）相对实力下降，体系内在矛盾（特里芬难题）激化 → 最终以“布雷顿森林体系崩溃”这一标志性事件，宣告了长波衰退期的正式来临 → 崩溃后的浮动汇率和信用货币体系，为整个1970年代的“滞胀”提供了制度温床，并重塑了全球的政治经济格局。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "8149-8207", "abstract": "在20世纪70年代长波的衰退期，布雷顿森林体系的崩溃实际上就是经济增长达到衰退阶段之后，主导国经济实力下降的一种反映", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "217417001_840BH0Cdh", "userVid": 217417001, "topics": [], "createTime": 1760841836, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 217417001, "name": "众善", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/XgAfYGGIakmyjZ3kD7yUoT85G9dfpAGdZojqn5gWMt1xrRGFsPzzqGZ4O19zGLbXNv0xxDHbMxFOS0lHnatutGy9XqKJrkZXmJv3pMXYz1w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "众善", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "275583425_82dVZOreE", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "20 世纪 60 年代后，随着欧洲和日本经济复苏，美元通过贸易逆差大量外流，形成 “欧洲美元” 市场。到 1971 年，海外美元存量达 400 亿，远超美国黄金储备。法国等国家开始大规模兑换黄金，1967-1968 年伦敦黄金市场爆发挤兑潮，迫使美国关闭黄金窗口。这种 “美元过剩” 与 “黄金短缺” 的矛盾，本质上是美国经济实力无法支撑其货币霸权的表现。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "在20世纪70年代长波的衰退期，布雷顿森林体系的崩溃实际上就是经济增长达到衰退阶段之后，主导国经济实力下降的一种反映", "range": "8149-8207", "reviewId": "275583425_82dVZOreE", "userVid": 275583425, "topics": [], "createTime": 1754555610, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 275583425, "name": "天天乐", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hqDXUD6csUiciaFDDda55ZqJT9vZJT8uAEmBPHV1WGiaNJwA0ibqoUHb5vz40DwDNyJa7ok4qnsmq1s/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241125-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 8}, {"reviewId": "66920859_84g5rTmUe", "review": {"abstract": "在20世纪70年代长波的衰退期，布雷顿森林体系的崩溃实际上就是经济增长达到衰退阶段之后，主导国经济实力下降的一种反映。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "不认可这个说法。美国不是第一个实行金本位的国家，也不是第一个放弃金本位的国家。在经济衰退时期，金本位可以防止通货膨胀，在经济繁荣时期，金本位导致通货紧缩。历史已经证明了，金本位是无法持续的，至于什么时候退出，要看政府的策略，如果繁荣时期退出更好，经济可以继续发展。在衰退期退出，就属于收拾烂摊子了。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8149-8208", "createTime": 1761721100, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "66920859_84g5rTmUe", "userVid": 66920859, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 66920859, "name": "大河奔流", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAyb83YJgia42gDZWpgSJujHsyADgwcd65Rre6WNVEH63maBQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一个人的判断能力受限于他的认知范围", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "不要跟蠢货讲道理！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 3, "commentsCount": 0, "hotComments": []}]}, {"range": "8605-8607", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "7122842_7Z3Tl2B4v", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "企稳指经济或金融指标在经历波动、下跌或不稳定后,逐渐停止下滑并趋于稳定,甚至可能转向回升的状态。这一概念既可用于宏观经济的整体形势,也可用于行业、企业。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "企稳", "range": "8605-8607", "reviewId": "7122842_7Z3Tl2B4v", "userVid": 7122842, "topics": [], "createTime": 1743420329, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 7122842, "name": "KK", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/WmwqjsSBsZLl7n8YdgVK50lm1S0oJHlTtibcwgZHKWhaPYf04tQzCuxrx5sic9GKC0AZN0fWVk1jw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}]}, {"range": "8675-8706", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "3183165_88zyybBzJ", "review": {"abstract": "美元指数在1973—1975年的企稳其实可以细分为以下两个阶段", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "布雷顿森林体系崩溃造成美元先贬值，后续出现的石油危机，使得德日受损程度超过美国，美元随后走强。\n该阶段美元企稳的主要原因是美国、德国与日本之间由于面对石油危机抗风险能力存在较大差异，造成经济增长此消彼长，德日受损程度超过美国，因此美元出现一波反弹，但不是反转。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "布雷顿森林体系崩溃造成美元先贬值，后续出现的石油危机，使得德日受损程度超过美国，美元随后走强。\n该阶段美元企稳的主要原因是美国、德国与日本之间由于面对石油危机抗风险能力存在较大差异，造成经济增长此消彼长，德日受损程度超过美国，因此美元出现一波反弹，但不是反转。", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "8675-8706", "createTime": 1776913424, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "3183165_88zyybBzJ", "userVid": 3183165, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1776914001, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 3183165, "name": "Chan", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0Lx53tbXl5m4uHibjMfo7AvyxJ11bIniabI8xOa7qwf5SiaYGcjENQQL7xkeGEpAMW5TcMVqzCExZN7B96QFyYcnF6xd1iaohgZdjeicZ4RaVo4E/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}]}, {"range": "8989-9019", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "426066534_8cQQzyaKa", "review": {"abstract": "为何美、德的通胀压力以及经济下滑与回暖的情况要远远好于日本？", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "一个重要原因是日本的产业结构对能源的高度依赖。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "一个重要原因是日本的产业结构对能源的高度依赖。", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8989-9019", "createTime": 1791981996, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "426066534_8cQQzyaKa", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1791982052, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}, {"reviewId": "3183165_88zyUvZME", "review": {"abstract": "为何美、德的通胀压力以及经济下滑与回暖的情况要远远好于日本？", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "美国因为整体经济部门完善且强大，因此抗风险能力本身就强，加之石油危机前，美德基本完成了经济的集约化改造，应对能源冲击能力更强一些，德国同时因为欧共体的建立，增强了经济纵深和抗风险能力，因此比日本受损要低。\n日本经济起步晚，石油危机时仍处于粗放型增长期，且不具备稳定的外部市场，因此抗风险能力较弱。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "8989-9019", "createTime": 1776913753, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "3183165_88zyUvZME", "userVid": 3183165, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 3183165, "name": "Chan", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0Lx53tbXl5m4uHibjMfo7AvyxJ11bIniabI8xOa7qwf5SiaYGcjENQQL7xkeGEpAMW5TcMVqzCExZN7B96QFyYcnF6xd1iaohgZdjeicZ4RaVo4E/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}]}, {"range": "9080-9115", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "223635575_8bYBEEWYE", "review": {"abstract": "美国经济于二战前便已完成了产业转型，这使得美国经济强于战败国德国和日本", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 9, "content": "美国与德日经济阶段差异，遭受的外部冲击不同", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "9080-9115", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "223635575_8bYBEEWYE", "userVid": 223635575, "topics": [], "createTime": 1788901117, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "http